    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---ABOUT THIS GAME<u>---</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Residing in a small town, separated by big cities, wide neighborhoods, and tons of buildings.<br><br>In Cute Fame Highschool Days, you will utilize turn-based combat with familiar mechanics to the series, like time-based attacks, and using health for damage to find your way through dungeons. While also getting closer to saving an important character each in-game day through progression and side stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute Fame Highschool Days is developed by Cute Fame Studio, and is a prequel to Cute Fames Adventure.  Both games were worked on by a solo developer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Singleplayer/Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Turn-Based Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Full 3D Overhaul</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 New Characters</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---ABOUT THIS GAME<u>---</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Residing in a small town, separated by big cities, wide neighborhoods, and tons of buildings.<br><br>In Cute Fame Highschool Days, you will utilize turn-based combat with familiar mechanics to the series, like time-based attacks, and using health for damage to find your way through dungeons. While also getting closer to saving an important character each in-game day through progression and side stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute Fame Highschool Days is developed by Cute Fame Studio, and is a prequel to Cute Fames Adventure.  Both games were worked on by a solo developer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Singleplayer/Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Turn-Based Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Full 3D Overhaul</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 New Characters</p>",
